  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Digital economy and governance</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Cooperation between Africa and Europe stands to benefit from digital technologies. Yet, without the right resources, policies and infrastructure, there&#x2019;s a risk of worsening digital divides and of digital technologies being misused. Our digital economy and governance team wants to promote digital cooperation within and between Africa and Europe as a way to advance sustainable development.Topics we look at include:1) The EU&#x2019;s geostrategic interests in its digital cooperation with Africa;2) The role of of digital tools in African regional integration;3) Digital infrastructure investments and financial services;4) Digital regulation and governance;5) Digital transformation for human development</narrative>
  </description>
